{"book":"2-kings","model":"glm-4.5","timestamp":"2026-05-03T08:16:07.293570284Z","verse":27,"ref":"2-kings 4:27","tier":"bulk","chapter":4,"translation":"And she came ⟨to⟩ the man of Elohim ⟨to⟩ the mountain, and she took hold ⟨of⟩ his feet. And Gehazi approached ⟨to⟩ thrust ⟨her⟩ away, and the man of Elohim said, 'Let her alone, for her soul ⟨is⟩ bitter ⟨to⟩ her, and ⟨the⟩ YHWH has hidden ⟨it⟩ from me, and has not told me.'","tokens":[{"surface":"ותבא","gloss":"And she came"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"⟨to⟩"},{"surface":"איש","gloss":"the man"},{"surface":"האלהים","gloss":"of Elohim"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"⟨to⟩"},{"surface":"ההר","gloss":"the mountain"},{"surface":"ותחזק","gloss":"and she took hold"},{"surface":"ברגליו","gloss":"⟨of⟩ his feet"},{"surface":"ויגש","gloss":"And Gehazi approached"},{"surface":"גיחזי","gloss":"Gehazi"},{"surface":"להדפה","gloss":"⟨to⟩ thrust ⟨her⟩ away"},{"surface":"ואמר","gloss":"and said"},{"surface":"איש","gloss":"the man"},{"surface":"האלהים","gloss":"of Elohim"},{"surface":"הרפה","gloss":"'Let her alone"},{"surface":"לה","gloss":"for her"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"for"},{"surface":"נפשה","gloss":"her soul ⟨is⟩"},{"surface":"מרה","gloss":"bitter ⟨to⟩ her"},{"surface":"לה","gloss":"to her"},{"surface":"ויהוה","gloss":"and YHWH"},{"surface":"העלים","gloss":"has hidden ⟨it⟩"},{"surface":"ממני","gloss":"from me"},{"surface":"ולא","gloss":"and has not"},{"surface":"הגיד","gloss":"told me"},{"surface":"לי","gloss":"to me"}]}